[{"id":124424,"sender_id":1518,"sender_full_name":"eprodan","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dbbf11bc58c3a4b5a95e46db56a88e9c?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/Inconsistency.20in.20the.20Heisenberg.20double.20nLab.20page/near/124424\">#1</a> In the page on <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Heisenberg%20double\">Heisenberg double</a>, the input is a bi-algebra pairing <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⊗</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle , \\rangle : A \\otimes B \\to k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span>, but in the expression of the left action we see <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle b,a \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span>, which makes no sense as written (or without additional comment on the symmetry of pairings).</p>","timestamp":1776605194,"subject":"Inconsistency in the Heisenberg double nLab page","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":124425,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/Inconsistency.20in.20the.20Heisenberg.20double.20nLab.20page/near/124425\">#2</a> Thanks for the alert. I have fixed it now (<a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Heisenberg+double\">here</a>).</p>","timestamp":1776607524,"subject":"Inconsistency in the Heisenberg double nLab page","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":124427,"sender_id":1518,"sender_full_name":"eprodan","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dbbf11bc58c3a4b5a95e46db56a88e9c?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/Inconsistency.20in.20the.20Heisenberg.20double.20nLab.20page/near/124427\">#3</a> Thanks.</p>","timestamp":1776607775,"subject":"Inconsistency in the Heisenberg double nLab page","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]}]